@startuml
title SafeStream-Redactor - Structural Model
' Corrected against entities.py, policy.py, report.py, redactor.py
class Redactor {
    -RedactionPolicy policy
    -float min_confidence
    -int chunk_size
    -int overlap
    -Calibrator calibrator
    +detector_names: List<str>
    +detect(text): List<Detection>
    +redact(text): str
    +redact_stream(chunks, stats): Iterator<str>
    +redact_file(input, output): RedactionStats
}
class RedactionPolicy {
    -RedactionMode mode
    -str replacement
    -Map replacements
    -int mask_keep_last
    -str mask_char
    -bytes hmac_key
    -int pseudonym_length
    +render(detection): str
    +apply(text, detections): str
}
class Detection {
    +int start
    +int end
    +str text
    +EntityType entity_type
    +float confidence
    +str source
    +Map meta
    +overlaps(other): bool
}
interface Detector {
    +name: str
    +detect(text): List<Detection>
}
class CustomDetector
class DeterministicDetector
class EntropyDetector
class NERDetector
class ContextualScorer
class Calibrator {
    +predict_one(detection): float
}
class RedactionStats {
    +Counter counts
    +int chars_in
    +int chars_out
    +int decode_replacements
    +total: int
    +add_segment(segment, redacted, detections)
    +merge(other)
    +summary(): str
}
enum RedactionMode {
    REPLACE
    MASK
    PSEUDONYMIZE
}
enum EntityType {
    EMAIL
    PHONE
    CREDIT_CARD
    SSN
    IPV4
    IPV6
    AWS_KEY
    AWS_SECRET
    GITHUB_TOKEN
    API_KEY
    JWT
    PRIVATE_KEY
    SLACK_TOKEN
    SLACK_WEBHOOK
    STRIPE_KEY
    GOOGLE_API_KEY
    SENDGRID_KEY
    TWILIO_KEY
    NPM_TOKEN
    OPENAI_KEY
    ANTHROPIC_KEY
    URL_CREDENTIALS
    SECRET
    PERSON
    ORG
    LOC
    CUSTOM
}
Redactor --> RedactionPolicy
Redactor --> Detector
Redactor --> RedactionStats
Redactor --> Calibrator
Detector <|.. CustomDetector
Detector <|.. DeterministicDetector
Detector <|.. EntropyDetector
Detector <|.. NERDetector
Detector <|.. ContextualScorer
Detector --> Detection
Detection --> EntityType
RedactionPolicy --> RedactionMode
RedactionPolicy --> Detection
Redactor "1" --> "*" Detection
@enduml
